{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13082","headline":"咸阳西楼别窦审 · 郎士元","name":"咸阳西楼别窦审","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西楼回起寒原上，霁日遥分万井间。\n小苑城隅连渭水，离宫曙色近京关。\n亭臯寂寞伤孤客，云雪萧条满衆山。\n时命如今犹未偶，辞君拟欲拂衣还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郎士元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13082.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13082","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}